{"3664650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dreadmark Outlaws", "steam_appid": 3664650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Dead West.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The West has fallen. Not to war – but to something far worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead are everywhere, and the few survivors left are fighting for another day.<br>In <strong>Dreadmark Outlaws</strong>, you fight your way through a grim Wild West filled with zombies, monsters and outlaws. Ride out alone, team up with friends, build defenses and grow stronger with every fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammunition is precious. The West is merciless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the perfect plan works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes everything just explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Both are Dreadmark Outlaws.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/cf1434ad15f19096581cdcff0a8efd01.poster.avif?t=1787757593\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/cf1434ad15f19096581cdcff0a8efd01.webm?t=1787757593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/cf1434ad15f19096581cdcff0a8efd01.mp4?t=1787757593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Campaign Through the Fallen West</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned settlements, dark mines and dangerous regions of the Wild West in a dedicated campaign.<br>Find better weapons, face new threats and gradually uncover what became of this world.<br>No safe towns. No great armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, your gun and the road ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alone or Together – Survive at Any Cost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, with bots or together with up to <strong>four players in online co-op</strong>.<br>Animal companions can journey through the fallen West with you and fight by your side.<br>Or switch sides and face other outlaws in PvP modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>six playable modes including the campaign</strong>, you decide how you want to experience the fallen West.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/02dd598f22a58e725b30c6ecbfc99250.poster.avif?t=1787757593\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/02dd598f22a58e725b30c6ecbfc99250.webm?t=1787757593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/02dd598f22a58e725b30c6ecbfc99250.mp4?t=1787757593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Stronger With Every Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated zombies and monsters drop loot that permanently improves your outlaw.<br>Spend the money you earn at the <strong>Trader</strong> on new weapons and outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight. Loot. Grow stronger. Ride out again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build. Defend. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the dead come in numbers, a quick trigger finger is no longer enough.<br>Build defenses, prepare your position and turn your surroundings into a deathtrap for the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become an outlaw legend.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/4d8c70aa6f34fad293a98507fc0cb7ae.poster.avif?t=1787757593\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/4d8c70aa6f34fad293a98507fc0cb7ae.webm?t=1787757593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/4d8c70aa6f34fad293a98507fc0cb7ae.mp4?t=1787757593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Than Just a Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Dreadmark Outlaws continues in the official <strong>Dreadmark Outlaws novel</strong>.<br>While the game throws you straight into the chaos of the fallen West, the novel dives deeper into <strong>its world, its characters and their story</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Ready | Full Controller Support | Singleplayer &amp; Online | Up to 4-Player Co-op</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/4d91597720a04287f93324b94478da0c.avif?t=1787757593\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Dead West.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The West has fallen. Not to war – but to something far worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead are everywhere, and the few survivors left are fighting for another day.<br>In <strong>Dreadmark Outlaws</strong>, you fight your way through a grim Wild West filled with zombies, monsters and outlaws. Ride out alone, team up with friends, build defenses and grow stronger with every fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammunition is precious. The West is merciless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the perfect plan works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes everything just explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Both are Dreadmark Outlaws.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/cf1434ad15f19096581cdcff0a8efd01.poster.avif?t=1787757593\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/cf1434ad15f19096581cdcff0a8efd01.webm?t=1787757593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/cf1434ad15f19096581cdcff0a8efd01.mp4?t=1787757593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Campaign Through the Fallen West</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned settlements, dark mines and dangerous regions of the Wild West in a dedicated campaign.<br>Find better weapons, face new threats and gradually uncover what became of this world.<br>No safe towns. No great armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, your gun and the road ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alone or Together – Survive at Any Cost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, with bots or together with up to <strong>four players in online co-op</strong>.<br>Animal companions can journey through the fallen West with you and fight by your side.<br>Or switch sides and face other outlaws in PvP modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>six playable modes including the campaign</strong>, you decide how you want to experience the fallen West.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664650/extras/02dd598f22a58e725b30c6ecbfc99250.poster.avif?t=1787757593\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset